  "extractionNotes": "Adoptive mother, self-employed on preferential contributions (base 1080.00 in 2023-11 and 2023-12) with voluntary sickness insurance from 2023-11-21, about 45 days before taking a 5-year-old child into care on 2024-01-05 with an adoption petition; before that a health-only start-up relief title. The title and the sickness insurance ended on 2024-01-23 (deregistration, title ceased); the benefit continued because the right arose during insurance. ZUS insurance memo: study date 2024-01-05, no arrears, base below 60% of the forecast wage, last document received 2024-01-15. Claims: ZAM for maternity-type leave 2024-01-05..2024-05-23 plus 32 weeks of parental leave (81.5% box unticked; joint claim, so 81.5% inferred), then ZUR for parental leave 2024-05-24..2025-01-02; the child holds a Za zyciem certificate, which extends parental leave to 65 weeks (56 weeks for one parent). Typed ZUS note: benefit paid 2024-01-05..2025-06-19 (532 days = 20 + 56 weeks). Only the overall period is printed; the split and the third block 2025-01-03..2025-06-19 (the extension) are reconstructed from the claims. Full adoption later ordered by the court (date redacted). asOf is not dated in the file; set to the start of the extension block."
